<title>USA: Owens Corning begins Fibreboard tender.</title>
<headline>Owens Corning begins Fibreboard tender.</headline>
<dateline>TOLEDO, Ohio 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Owens Corning said Friday a wholly owned subsidiary has begun a $55-a-share cash tender offer for Fibreboard Corp.</p>
<p>Owens Corning, a building products manufacturer, and Fibreboard, a maker of vinyl sidings, agreed to merge on May 27.</p>
<p>Owens Corning said in a news release that the tender offer is scheduled to expire on June 26.</p>
<p>Dealer-manager for the offering is Merrill Lynch and Co.</p>
</text>
